    <item>
      <title>中国用户用Claude和Cursor时卡在哪，大厂转向生产力市场</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai002/post/20260901/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E7%94%A8Claude%E5%92%8CCursor%E6%97%B6%E5%8D%A1%E5%9C%A8%E5%93%AA%E5%A4%A7%E5%8E%82%E8%BD%AC%E5%90%91%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E5%8A%9B%E5%B8%82%E5%9C%BA/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
